IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GENERATE-ALBUM-ID.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  GENERATED-ID       PIC X(40).
01  CURRENT-DATETIME.
    05  CURRENT-DATE     PIC X(8).  
    05  CURRENT-TIME     PIC X(6).  
01  RANDOM-PART        PIC X(26). 

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "CBL_GET_CURRENT_DATETIME" USING CURRENT-DATETIME.
    MOVE CURRENT-DATE TO GENERATED-ID(1:8).
    MOVE CURRENT-TIME TO GENERATED-ID(9:6).

    CALL "CBL_RANDOM_STRING" USING 26, RANDOM-PART.
    MOVE RANDOM-PART TO GENERATED-ID(15:40).

    GOBACK.
